```lean
Ordnode.merge_node.{u_1} {α : Type u_1} {ls : ℕ} {ll : Ordnode α} {lx : α} {lr : Ordnode α} {rs : ℕ} {rl : Ordnode α}
  {rx : α} {rr : Ordnode α} :
  (node ls ll lx lr).merge (node rs rl rx rr) =
    if delta * ls < rs then ((node ls ll lx lr).merge rl).balanceL rx rr
    else
      if delta * rs < ls then ll.balanceR lx (lr.merge (node rs rl rx rr))
      else (node ls ll lx lr).glue (node rs rl rx rr)
```

